{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>For in abundance</b>. Like <b>for a dream comes with abundance of matters</b> [Ecclesiastes 5:2], only <b>fear Elohim in every thing</b>, or his matter — see, you have many dreams and words of vapor, and talking much — only fear Elohim. The meaning is that every utterance is permitted to you except if it contains a mention of the Name."], :book :ecclesiastes, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%A7%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:27:43.110266369Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}